Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.97,0:01:56.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonunda geldin!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.44,0:02:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Jinbe!\N– Jinbe!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.44,0:02:15.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Millet! Bugünden itibaren,\NSunny'nin tayfasındayım.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.41,0:02:21.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin için çok endişelenmiştim!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.00,0:02:23.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni çok özledim!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.08,0:02:26.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Patron!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.96,0:02:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi tekrar gördüğüme\Nben de çok sevindim!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.42,0:02:36.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eski Shicibukai Jinbe'nin tayfamıza katılması...!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.89,0:02:38.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok güven verici!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.31,0:02:42.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi olmana çok sevindim!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.23,0:02:47.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-{\i1}san{\i0}...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.65,0:02:49.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ona o kadar sıkı sarılman gerekmiyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.74,0:03:00.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizi gerçekten endişelendirdin, sersem!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.16,0:03:02.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm, üzgünüm!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.91,0:03:06.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güneş Korsanları'nın yaralarını\Nsarmam gerekiyordu...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.83,0:03:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve veda partim de epey coşkuluydu.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.84,0:03:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani ayrılmam biraz zaman aldı.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.21,0:03:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunun için üzgünüm.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.01,0:03:17.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Millet, tekrardan...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.80,0:03:22.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sizlerle yolculuk etmek\Nbenim için çok büyük bir mutluluk!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.48,0:03:29.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe'nin dümen yetenekleri inanılmazdır!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.40,0:03:32.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Resmen Sunny ile sörf yapıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.02,0:03:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.32,0:03:40.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonunda hayallerin gemisini\Ntam kapasite kullanabilecek biri çıktı.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.53,0:03:42.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi kadeh kaldıralım!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.12,0:03:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.75,0:03:48.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kadeh kaldırma zamanı!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.08,0:03:49.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Evet!\N– Evet!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, bekleyin.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.75,0:03:53.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemide hiç içkimiz kalmadı.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.38,0:03:54.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aslında,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.13,0:03:58.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,burnuma içki kokusu geliyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.43,0:03:59.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nereden be?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.80,0:04:00.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şuradan.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.80,0:04:01.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.10,0:04:07.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.10,0:04:09.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.69,0:04:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizinle Onigashima'ya varınca\Nne yapacağımızı görüşmek istiyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.90,0:04:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acilen gelebilir misiniz, Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0}?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.49,0:04:21.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalancı!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.62,0:04:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben sadece deniz kokusu alıyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.66,0:04:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalan söylemiyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de yemek kokusu alıyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.75,0:04:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.54,0:04:33.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boş ver, Kin.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.84,0:04:37.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlarla plan yapmak anlamsız.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.72,0:04:41.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hem benim gemimdesiniz.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.84,0:04:44.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strateji planlayacaksanız başka gemiye gidin.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.44,0:04:59.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin şu planını...\Nben de duymak isterim.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.58,0:05:07.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam Güç Shishilian-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.54,0:05:12.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu savaşta Dük Inuarashi,\NKozuki Oden'in hizmetkârı olarak savaşacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.46,0:05:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani minklere ben önderlik etmeliyim!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.88,0:05:18.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, sana güveniyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.13,0:05:19.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İzin verin...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.34,0:05:26.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano samuraylarına da ben önderlik edeyim.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.56,0:05:32.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Patron Hyogoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.69,0:05:36.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geçen şu yirmi yıldaki yokluğum için beni bağışlayın.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.69,0:05:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi iyi gördüğüme sevindim.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.99,0:05:44.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık Onigashima'ya vardığımızda\Nne yapacağımızı belirleyelim.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.82,0:05:45.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.74,0:05:50.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlara bu geminin bakımevi olmadığını söylemedim mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.87,0:05:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.37,0:05:56.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi Onigashima'ya baskın planımızı sunacağım!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.25,0:05:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haritadan görüldüğü üzere
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.42,0:06:03.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Onigashima, etrafı dağlarla çevrili bir adadır.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.43,0:06:08.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz yoluyla yaklaşma girişimleri\Nsarp kayalıklar sebebiyle engelleniyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.18,0:06:10.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İmkânsız!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.68,0:06:16.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adaya girmenin yegane yolu ön kapıdan geçmektir!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.27,0:06:22.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurukafa dağın bir parçası ve\Niçine bir kale inşa edilmiş.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.49,0:06:25.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Malikâne planını ele geçirerek...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.49,0:06:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kalenin arka tarafında da\Nbir geçit olduğunu öğrendik!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.08,0:06:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıkı korunan ön kapıdan girmek yerine...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.50,0:06:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,iki grup olup sol ve sağdaki\Ndağ yollarından dolanıp...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.34,0:06:40.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,arka geçitten sızacağız.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.55,0:06:46.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Festival anında, Kaido'nun sarhoşluğunu fırsat bilip ona sürpriz bir saldırı yapacağız,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.14,0:06:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve bütün işi bir çırpıda bitireceğiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.56,0:06:54.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zekice...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.39,0:07:04.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek Kanjuro'yu aldatmak için ona anlattığın basit plan buydu...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.49,0:07:05.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eee...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.86,0:07:08.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki, asıl planın ne?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.95,0:07:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.83,0:07:14.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine pireyi deve yapma işi...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.04,0:07:15.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öncelikle...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.58,0:07:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,düşmanın baskından haberi olduğunu...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.63,0:07:23.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve ana hedefinin\NKızıl Kın samurayları olduğunu varsayalım.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca, ben...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.51,0:07:30.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka-{\i1}ya{\i0} ve Eustass-{\i1}ya{\i0}...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.55,0:07:32.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz üç kaptan da hedefteyiz...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.39,0:07:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.14,0:07:37.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Plan ne olursa olsun,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.77,0:07:42.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ön kapıdan dalacak iki aptal var, bunu biliyoruz!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.82,0:07:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama o iki aptal\Ndikkat dağıtmakta iyi...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.82,0:07:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve sıradan yemlere göre epey güçlüler.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.08,0:07:57.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O aptalları durdurmak için\NKaido'nun tonla adamı ön saflara sürülecek.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.62,0:07:59.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.29,0:08:05.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun kuvvetleri ön kapıya yığılırsa\Ndağ patikalarının güvenliği zayıflar!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.63,0:08:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani plana sadık kalıp\Ndağ yollarını kullanacağız.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.10,0:08:11.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ancak...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.93,0:08:15.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,patikalardan ilerleyenler de\Naslında yem olacaklar!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.68,0:08:16.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.89,0:08:22.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğal olarak bizler, hayatlarımızı\Nfeda etmeye hazır şekilde buraya geldik...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.15,0:08:27.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,böylece Kin'emon'un grubunu\Nasıl savaşa götürebiliriz.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.24,0:08:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman Kızıl Kınlar nasıl ilerleyecek?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.28,0:08:32.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denizden.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.20,0:08:36.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama girdaplar izin vermez!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.87,0:08:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endişelenmeyin.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.37,0:08:39.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bize bir şey olmaz.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.33,0:08:43.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Polar Tang{\i0}'la denize dalarız...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.92,0:08:48.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve adanın çevresinden dolaşıp\Nyoldaki girdaplardan sıyrılırız.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.13,0:08:50.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ardından...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.76,0:08:55.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yeteneğimle sizi adaya ışınlarım.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.39,0:09:00.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size minnettarız!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.90,0:09:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama Law-{\i1}dono{\i0},\Nhâlâ askerlere önderlik etmem gerek.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.03,0:09:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Katılıyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.94,0:09:13.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de diğer patikaya önderlik ederim,\Nböylece iki tarafı da yönetiriz!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.95,0:09:14.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.62,0:09:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.62,0:09:16.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.58,0:09:17.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Inuarashi!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.66,0:09:18.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kikunojo!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.87,0:09:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ashura!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaşıldı.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.25,0:09:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüm gücümüzü ve enerjimizi Kaido'ya saklayacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.46,0:09:29.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.47,0:09:32.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam da planladığım gibi...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bu stratejiyi kullanalım!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.30,0:09:36.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte tanıdığım Kin-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.18,0:09:37.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kusursuz plan!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnanılmaz...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.69,0:09:47.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu {\i1}torii{\i0} kapısı...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.32,0:09:51.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima baskını yolundaki ilk engel bu.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.28,0:09:53.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Engel mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.07,0:09:54.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Muhafızlar var mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.45,0:09:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet ama hepsi bu değil.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.33,0:10:00.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orası toplardan ve silahlardan geçilmiyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.96,0:10:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Küçük bir kale gibi.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.84,0:10:08.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve bugün Ateş Festivali günü.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.46,0:10:12.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Muhtemelen çok sayıda asker\Norada bir ziyafet düzenliyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.22,0:10:16.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun, ya baskından haberdar edilmişlerse?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.72,0:10:20.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O hâlde onlar için kolay hedef oluruz.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.10,0:10:21.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu iyi değil!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.48,0:10:22.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her halükârda...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.06,0:10:25.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,herkesi hemen bilgilendirmemiz gerekiyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.65,0:10:30.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.65,0:10:33.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar'ın gemisi kayıp.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.78,0:10:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?!\N– Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.12,0:10:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olamaz! Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0} orada mı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.25,0:10:42.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Law-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.45,0:10:44.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemiyi lütfen o yöne çevirin!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.08,0:10:45.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acele onları kurtarmalıyız!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.67,0:10:49.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lastik-Lastik...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.05,0:10:50.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa...?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.43,0:11:01.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaklaşmalarına izin vermeyin!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.10,0:11:02.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ateş, ateş!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.31,0:11:05.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lastik-Lastik...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.60,0:11:09.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Mitralyöz!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.58,0:11:26.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lastik-Lastik...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.79,0:11:29.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Pistol!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.02,0:11:46.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}İki Kılıç Stili...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.15,0:11:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Şahin Taarruzu!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.59,0:12:14.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Etrafım çevrildi.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.67,0:12:16.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yakalayın!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.01,0:12:20.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Soul Solid!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.48,0:12:33.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Kırlangıç...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.23,0:12:34.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Flaması!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.74,0:12:49.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bin Çiçek, Devasa El:
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.55,0:12:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Tepik!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.32,0:13:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-{\i1}chan{\i0}...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.62,0:13:26.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, sen!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.16,0:13:28.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne dikilip duruyorsun?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.00,0:13:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Böğür!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.13,0:13:43.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Franky...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.01,0:13:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Boksu!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.93,0:13:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Süper!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.10,0:13:56.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz olmadan da\Ngayet iyi idare ediyorlar gibi.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.95,0:14:07.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Helal, çocuklar! Aferin!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fena değildi.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.08,0:14:09.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İdare ederdi!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.04,0:14:11.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Millet, iyi işti!\N– Millet, iyi işti!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.58,0:14:13.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bari biraz yardım etseydiniz!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.71,0:14:16.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Torii{\i0} kapısındaki düşmanlar...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.92,0:14:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,tamamen temizlendi!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.67,0:14:21.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar silahları olduğuna bakın!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.55,0:14:23.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eğer bize saldırsaydılar...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.09,0:14:27.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, ne çok adam kaybederdik\Ndüşünmek bile istemiyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.10,0:14:31.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık gidebiliriz, değil mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.48,0:14:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima'ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.21,0:14:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok soğuk!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.00,0:14:57.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Bir varili bile tutamıyor musunuz?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.09,0:15:01.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden sizle içmekten nefret ediyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Şogun-{\i1}sama{\i0}!\N– Şogun-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.56,0:15:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alkış sesine gelin.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.40,0:15:22.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte oradasınız! Geliyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.95,0:15:33.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Şogun-{\i1}sama{\i0},\Nözellikle bugün moraliniz epey iyi.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.87,0:15:34.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.96,0:15:37.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yüzünüzde güller açıyor, bir şey mi oldu?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.88,0:15:40.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nereden anladınız?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.17,0:15:42.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He? Ne oldu?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.13,0:15:48.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yolumda sürekli duran\Nçöp parçaları vardı...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.84,0:15:53.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama sonunda onlardan kurtulduk.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.14,0:15:57.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atılan çöpler yüzünden mi mutlusunuz?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.77,0:16:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şogun-{\i1}sama{\i0} kesinlikle tuhaf biri!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.27,0:16:01.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Değil mi?!\N– Değil mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.61,0:16:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kadar tuhaf mıyım?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.90,0:16:06.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, öylesiniz!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.61,0:16:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama sevimli bir şekilde!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.82,0:16:10.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Değil mi?!\N– Değil mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.79,0:16:15.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaklaşsanıza biraz!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.91,0:16:20.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben Wano şogunu, Kurozumi Orochi'yim!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.09,0:16:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.30,0:16:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha fazla {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} istiyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.34,0:16:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Az bekleyin, lütfen!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.01,0:16:30.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom da istiyor...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.72,0:16:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.80,0:16:34.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne olmuş yani?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.22,0:16:38.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu gece, yılda bir kutlanan\NAltın Festival gecesi!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.85,0:16:42.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurtlarını döküp gönlünce\Ndans edebileceğin özel bir gece.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.48,0:16:45.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki, bu gecenin asıl yıldızı kim?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.15,0:16:47.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Queen!\N– Queen!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.53,0:16:49.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle! Benim!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.53,0:16:53.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şarkısıyla, dansıyla herkesi büyüleyen o isim kim?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.37,0:16:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Queen!\N– Queen!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.70,0:16:57.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen öyle! Benim!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.16,0:17:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üstelik kilo verirsem çok daha...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.83,0:17:02.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,popüler olurum.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.76,0:17:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyice anladıysan git bana {\i1}oshiruko{\i0} getir, seni aptal!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.09,0:17:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkeste bir heyecan var...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.81,0:17:15.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.85,0:17:18.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bugünkü gösteriyi izlemek\Niçin sabırsızlanıyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama o ne yapıyor?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.73,0:17:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Efendim...?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.56,0:17:23.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oğlumdan bahsediyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.31,0:17:25.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu bir festival! Bir yüzünü gösterseydi!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.90,0:17:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hemen ilgileniyorum, efendim!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.24,0:17:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.28,0:17:33.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tobi Roppo'nun altısı da vardı.\NLütfen onları kabul edin!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.12,0:17:37.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ, haydi onları Linlin ile tanıştıralım.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.00,0:17:39.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kocakarı nereye kayboldu?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.16,0:17:41.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.71,0:17:45.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom şu an kimonosunu giyiyor...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.13,0:17:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.71,0:17:48.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.05,0:17:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tobi Roppo geldi!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları içeri alın.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.16,0:19:06.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,1014)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord0\shad0\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx85\blur0.6\fscy85}Sonunda, parti zamanı, yo!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.08,0:19:08.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,1014)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord0\shad0\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx85\blur0.6\fscy85}İşte geliyor şampiyon Brachio,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.09,0:19:11.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,1014)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord0\shad0\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx85\blur0.6\fscy85}Veba...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.51,0:19:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,1014)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord0\shad0\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx85\blur0.6\fscy85}Queen!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.69,0:19:28.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepinize beklediğiniz için teşekkür ediyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.27,0:19:31.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yılda bir kutlanan festival zamanı geldi!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.44,0:19:34.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haydi coşalım!
