Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.43,0:20:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,1014)\fad(150,150)\b0\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnDumpling-Regular\fs74.25}Şarkı söyleyip dans etme zamanıdır,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.89,0:20:07.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,66)\fad(150,150)\b0\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnDumpling-Regular\fs74.25}– ...funk!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.89,0:20:07.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,1014)\fad(150,150)\b0\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnDumpling-Regular\fs74.25}– ...funk!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.52,0:20:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ! Onigashima!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.77,0:20:14.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coşku tavan mı, ha?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.03,0:20:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,66)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord0\shad0\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fs74.25\fscx90\blur0.6\fscy90}– Evet!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.03,0:20:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,1014)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord0\shad0\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fs74.25\fscx90\blur0.6\fscy90}– Evet!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.32,0:20:17.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşte başlıyoruz, millet!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.36,0:20:19.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her zamanki yoklamayı alıyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.91,0:20:23.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yüreğinizi ortaya koyun!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.33,0:20:27.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,1014)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord0\shad0\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx85\blur0.6\fscy85}Bekle dur sıranı, geldi zamanın!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.25,0:20:29.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,66)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord0\shad0\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx85\blur0.6\fscy85}Sıkılmadınız mı, Fırsatçılar takımı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.92,0:20:35.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an5\pos(960,1014)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.38\shad2.7\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx91\fscy91}Bahsi kaybettiniz ama bastınız kahkahayı,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.05,0:20:36.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,66)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord0\shad0\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx85\blur0.6\fscy85}Boş verin gülün, Hazcılar takımı!
