Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.85,0:20:45.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,66)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord0\shad0\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx85\blur0.6\fscy85}Haydi, kükreyin, Yetenekliler takımı!
