Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.52,0:20:53.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,66)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.38\shad2.7\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx91\fscy91}Tarif edilemez artık bu seviyeler!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.07,0:20:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,1014)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.38\shad2.7\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx91\fscy91}En sağlam altılı, işte o asiler,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.11,0:21:00.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,66)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.38\shad2.7\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx91\fscy91}Sonsuz tehlike, sınırsız güç:
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.45,0:21:03.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,66)\fad(150,150)\b1\bord0\shad0\fnFOT-ComicReggae Std B\fscx85\blur0.6\fscy85}Tobi Roppo!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.62,0:21:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şakaydı!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.67,0:21:14.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zaten buna hiç katılmamışlardı ki...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.96,0:21:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O küstah şerefsizleri boş verin!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.80,0:21:20.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sırada, canavarlar var!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.01,0:21:21.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Numbers!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.43,0:21:31.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her yeri sardılar!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.23,0:21:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aman...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.31,0:21:34.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıra Orochi'nin adamlarında! Başlıyoruz!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.61,0:21:37.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Önce, samuray devriye ekibi!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.57,0:21:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve Oniwabanshu!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.28,0:21:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca bu yıl\Nçok önemli misafirlerimiz var!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.91,0:21:48.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duyduğum kadarıyla çok yakındalar!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.41,0:21:49.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?\N– Ne?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.50,0:21:51.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom'ın çocukları!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.96,0:21:52.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?!\N– Ne?!
Dialogue: 550,0:21:56.00,0:21:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen'in gevezeliği\Nbırakacağını sanmıyorum.
Dialogue: 550,0:21:59.05,0:22:03.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O herifin kalkıp da Tobi Roppo'ya\Nküstah demesine katlanacak mıyız yani?!
Dialogue: 550,0:22:03.13,0:22:05.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle konuşmayı kes.
Dialogue: 550,0:22:05.93,0:22:07.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeni tarzın bu mu?
Dialogue: 550,0:22:07.76,0:22:09.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok utanç verici...
Dialogue: 550,0:22:09.06,0:22:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi ama, Pay-Pay, hep çok utangaçsın.
Dialogue: 550,0:22:12.02,0:22:14.10,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana Pay-Pay deme!
Dialogue: 550,0:22:16.48,0:22:19.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen şimdi ölürse...
Dialogue: 550,0:22:19.82,0:22:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sizce bir sonraki önder kim olur?
Dialogue: 550,0:22:24.24,0:22:27.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tahmin edeyim... sen mi olursun?
Dialogue: 550,0:22:29.33,0:22:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim önder olmak gibi bir niyetim yok.
Dialogue: 550,0:22:33.29,0:22:38.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman yarışmadan çekilmen harika olur.
Dialogue: 550,0:22:39.00,0:22:41.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin de harcın değil Pay-Pay.\NHavlu atacaksın, değil mi?
Dialogue: 550,0:22:41.92,0:22:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 550,0:22:42.72,0:22:47.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendine "Soba Maskesi" diyen\Nbir soytarının kaçmasına izin verdin.
Dialogue: 550,0:22:49.43,0:22:51.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulan!
Dialogue: 550,0:22:51.47,0:22:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay'ime bulaşırsan kafanı kırarım, Sasaki!
Dialogue: 550,0:22:55.60,0:22:57.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, kes şunu, abla!
Dialogue: 550,0:22:57.77,0:22:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Kes şunu" mu dedin?!
Dialogue: 550,0:22:59.07,0:23:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana kızmasana!
Dialogue: 550,0:23:00.19,0:23:03.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Kızma" mı dedin?! Ulan...
Dialogue: 550,0:23:03.53,0:23:06.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz veletler sinirlerimi bozuyorsunuz.
Dialogue: 550,0:23:06.20,0:23:08.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten mi? Bence çok tatlılar.
Dialogue: 550,0:23:10.66,0:23:14.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tatlı küçük Ul-{\i1}chan{\i0}'ımız herkese çatıyor.
Dialogue: 550,0:23:14.75,0:23:15.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki...
Dialogue: 550,0:23:16.50,0:23:19.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bizi neden sırf bekletmek için çağırdılar?
Dialogue: 550,0:23:19.75,0:23:21.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Acil bir iş" çıkmış!
Dialogue: 550,0:23:21.59,0:23:24.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-{\i1}san{\i0} bir şeylerin\Nönemli olduğunu söylerse...
Dialogue: 550,0:23:24.88,0:23:27.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bunun cidden bir anlamı vardır.
Dialogue: 550,0:23:27.84,0:23:30.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aydınlatın beni, yine mi aile meselesi?
Dialogue: 550,0:23:37.65,0:23:39.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido aptal mı?
Dialogue: 550,0:23:39.23,0:23:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Tek çatmaman gereken kişi o!\N– Tek çatmaman gereken kişi o!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.70,0:23:49.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.24,0:23:51.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kötü adamları bulduk!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.75,0:23:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes bize yetişti mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.21,0:23:58.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yosun Kafa!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.63,0:23:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.50,0:24:01.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nereden buldun onu?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.21,0:24:05.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokusunu alıyorum demiştim sana!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:05.01,0:24:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saf içgüdü...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.68,0:24:08.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.30,0:24:11.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her şey hazır!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.18,0:24:12.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oley!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.39,0:24:15.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi kadeh kaldıralım!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.14,0:24:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.56,0:24:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eğer gelmezsen hepsini içeceğiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.77,0:24:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani Zoro içer.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.56,0:24:22.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bi' rahat ver be!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.94,0:24:24.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.48,0:24:26.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buyurun Patron-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.20,0:24:28.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teşekkür ederim.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.78,0:24:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her zaman aradığımız o {\i1}süper{\i0}\Ndümenciye kadeh kaldıralım!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.33,0:24:36.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keşke bir şarkı söyleyecek vaktimiz olsaydı.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.29,0:24:43.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiç bu kadar neşeli bir ruh hâliyle sake içmemiştim.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.38,0:24:44.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.46,0:24:46.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazır mıyız, millet?!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.88,0:24:48.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Evet!\N– Evet!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.39,0:24:54.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b0\bord3.38\shad2.7}♪ Tayfamıza katılan...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.47,0:24:58.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b0\bord3.38\shad2.7} Jinbe'nin şerefine– ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.31,0:25:00.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teşekkürler, Luffy-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.31,0:25:03.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hattı kaşla göz arasında yardınız!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.60,0:25:02.77,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.52,0:25:06.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size minnettarız!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.16,0:25:18.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Herkes çok heyecanlı!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:18.79,0:25:23.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mevziyi ele geçirmek herkese müthiş şevk vermiş olmalı!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.04,0:25:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi fırtına gibi Onigashima'ya çökerler.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.46,0:25:31.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-O-O zaman şu kadehi bitirelim\Nve onlara yetişelim!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.01,0:25:40.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffytaro ve diğerlerinin bize verdiği\Nbu fırsatı boşa harcamayacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.14,0:25:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet! Düşmana hazırlık şansı vermeyeceğiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.10,0:25:46.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar çok güvenilir!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.90,0:25:47.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.15,0:25:54.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onunla tanıştığım andan beri\Numutsuzluğu umuda çevirdi!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.28,0:25:58.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki samurayları!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.83,0:26:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ey kararlı savaşçılar!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.62,0:26:03.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ardımızdan gelin!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.67,0:26:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüm gemiler, Onigashima'ya!{Wano 55 - 21:00}
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.93,0:26:13.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İleri!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.15,0:26:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aklından geçen ne?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.58,0:26:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.99,0:26:40.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.29,0:26:41.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.04,0:26:41.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?\N– Ne?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.00,0:26:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz de onlara katılalım!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.58,0:26:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ha?!\N– Ha?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.38,0:26:47.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ziyafet ve kadeh kaldırmayı...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.05,0:26:51.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'yu alaşağı ettikten sonraya bırakalım!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:52.63,0:26:56.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve Orochi'yle Big Mom'ı da unutmayalım!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.01,0:26:58.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu savaşı kazandıktan sonra...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.93,0:27:01.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,çekeceğimiz ziyafet...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.77,0:27:05.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,en büyük ziyafetimiz olacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.11,0:27:12.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öf be. Kadeh kaldırmamız gerektiğini söyleyen sendin.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.28,0:27:14.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hep burnunun dikine gidiyorsun!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.15,0:27:16.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-{\i1}san{\i0} haklı.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.41,0:27:17.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Harbi mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.16,0:27:21.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zaten öteden beri böyleydi.\NŞimdi sızlanmanın âlemi yok.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.08,0:27:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sen onaylama!\N– Sen onaylama!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.58,0:27:27.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizim için hava hoş da...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.54,0:27:30.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ya sen ne dersin Patron-{\i1}san{\i0}?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.09,0:27:35.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cevabımı biliyorsunuz.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.64,0:27:41.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Varım!\N– Varım!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.27,0:27:48.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim, çocuklar!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.10,0:27:51.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samurayların peşinden!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.11,0:27:54.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hayhay, Kaptan!\N– Hayhay, Kaptan!
Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.90,0:01:36.53,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\blur0.6\fad(725,0)}Parti Sona Erdi!!!
